body.en:
The administrator keeps the system running day to day:

- **maintain** the fleet (machines, servers);
- **configure** the system and services;
- **solve incidents** (failures, errors, slowness);
- **install and update** software;
- **manage disks** (partitions, space);
- **manage users and access** (accounts, groups, rights);
- **plan the evolution** of the fleet.
